AgentNotch bundles or adapts code from the following third-party projects.

================================================================================
open-focus — https://github.com/fillsoko/open-focus
================================================================================

Portions of Sources/AgentNotchCore/Notch/NotchGeometry.swift (the
auxiliaryTopLeftArea/auxiliaryTopRightArea width derivation) and
Sources/AgentNotch/Notch/NotchGeometry.swift (built-in screen selection), the
NSPanel configuration in Sources/AgentNotch/Notch/NotchPanel.swift, the
UnevenRoundedRectangle notch-continuation shape in
Sources/AgentNotch/Views/NotchChrome.swift, and scripts/build_app.sh are
adapted from open-focus.

